  </Box>
  <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 0.5 }}>回报敏感性测算：最差 3.8 倍，中性 22.5 倍，行业锚 38 倍起</Text>
  <Box style={{ width: 1168, height: 1, background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.14)', marginTop: 16 }} />
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 36, marginTop: 34, height: 430 }}>
