          <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 62, background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.10)', border: '1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.22)', boxShadow: '0 12px 36px rgba(0,0,0,0.55)', borderRadius: 16, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#E2E8F0', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>15x</Text></Box>
          <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 62, background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.10)', border: '1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.22)', boxShadow: '0 12px 36px rgba(0,0,0,0.55)', borderRadius: 16, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#E2E8F0', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>45x</Text></Box>
          <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 62, background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.10)', border: '1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.22)', boxShadow: '0 12px 36px rgba(0,0,0,0.55)', borderRadius: 16, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#E2E8F0', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>75x</Text></Box>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>估值锚：头部 AI 公司 = ARR 40—60 倍（西部证券 2026-08：OpenAI ~47x、Cursor ~40-65x）；传统 SaaS 仅 10—20 倍。<br />下轮确定性：12 个月即达 A 轮门槛（机构要求 ARR 2,200—3,600 万，推演 1 亿）。</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 24, left: 56 }}>
